test('explicitly approved assist policy: normal mouse shots are manual; Magnet Mouths retains its effect',()=>{const{sim}=makeCourse({...courses[0],start:[4,10]});const other=sim.frogs[1];other.body.setActive(true);other.body.setTransform(Vec2(9,10.5),0);const f=sim.frogs[0];sim.fire(f,{x:0,y:0,held:true,aimX:1,aimY:0});assert.deepEqual(f.tongue!.direction,{x:1,y:0});assert.equal(f.aimAssistTarget,undefined);sim.fire(f,{x:1,y:0,held:true});assert.equal(f.aimAssistTarget,1);applyChaos(sim,['magnet_mouths']);sim.fire(f,{x:0,y:0,held:true,aimX:1,aimY:0});assert.equal(f.aimAssistTarget,1);assert.ok(f.tongue!.direction.y>0);});
